
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant UI as UIController
    participant M as Main
    participant AD as ArrayData
    participant SA as SortingAlgorithm
    participant PC as PlaybackController
    participant V as Visualizer

    Note over U, V: 页面初始化
    M->>M: init()
    M->>AD: new ArrayData()
    M->>AD: generateRandom(默认大小)
    M->>V: new Visualizer(canvas)
    M->>PC: new PlaybackController()
    M->>UI: new UIController()
    UI->>UI: bindEvents()
    M->>V: render(初始数组, [], 初始统计)

    Note over U, V: 用户选择算法并点击“开始”
    U->>UI: 从下拉菜单选择算法
    UI->>M: onAlgorithmChange()
    M->>M: 根据选择实例化对应SortingAlgorithm子类
    U->>UI: 点击“开始”按钮
    UI->>M: onPlaybackClick('start')
    M->>M: runVisualization()
    M->>SA: sort(AD)
    SA->>AD: getArray()
    SA->>SA: 执行排序逻辑，通过step()记录每一步
    SA-->>M: 返回steps数组
    M->>PC: loadSteps(steps)
    PC->>PC: 重置状态
    PC->>PC: play()
    loop 动画循环
        PC->>PC: 获取当前step
        PC->>V: render(step.array, step.highlights, step.stats)
        PC->>UI: updateInfoPanel(step)
        PC->>PC: 等待speed毫秒后更新currentStep
    end

    Note over U, V: 用户交互（例如暂停、调速）
    U->>UI: 点击“暂停”
    UI->>PC: pause()
    PC->>PC: clearTimeout(timerId)
    U->>UI: 拖动速度滑块
    UI->>PC: setSpeed(newSpeed)

    Note over U, V: 用户生成新数据
    U->>UI: 点击“随机生成”
    UI->>AD: generateRandom(新大小)
    UI->>M: 触发重置流程
    M->>PC: reset()
    M->>V: render(新数组, [], 新统计)
